after the split of RTAI and Xenomai(fusion), I would just like to
announce that the cross referencing site hosted at University of
Hannover was split as well.

RTAI:    www.rts.uni-hannover.de/rtai/lxr
Xenomai: www.rts.uni-hannover.de/xenomai/lxr

I will try to keep both services running in the future, though our own
focus is moving away from RTAI. But I think this service is useful for
both communities to have a sneak view on the other side from time to
time. ;)

